 191:   chirotope (validity is defined by the chamber/side incidence, which is
 192:   functorial in the chirotope).
 193: 
 194: These are exactly the claims a subtle error could hide in, so they are
 195: **checked computationally, exactly**, in `check_transport.py`:
 196: transported multipliers of sampled certificates from every bundle
