 224:   dual to a great-circle arrangement on S², 2-colorable by parity of
 225:   the sign vector). Each bicolored chamber contributes exactly one
 226:   segment: the zero plane meets a strictly convex open cone in a single
 227:   connected sector, so no chamber is re-entered. 43 needs 21 bicolored
 228:   chambers, odd; and a 43-vertex instance with equalities perturbs to
 229:   ≥ 43 strict, hence to 44 — dead either way.
